- Catch reports via the injected `opts.warn`, falling back to `console.warn`, so no error is swallowed (rule 3); it resolves rather than throwing for missing/broken files.
- Exported function carries a `@returns` JSDoc tag (rule 9), and only `console.warn` is used, never `console.log` (rule 8).

